            "paragraph": "The northerly position of the Gulf Stream wall, Gulf Stream transport, and surface AMOC dynamics are positively correlated with winter NAO values41-45.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
